      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baudette%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1910 a devastating fire razed Baudette, but a train carrying boxcars crossed the Rainy River to rescue many residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
